OL,3,AThousands dress up for dazzling Derry
OL,4,AHalloween parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people are enjoying the
OL,7,Fmain parade of the Halloween festival
OL,8,Fin Londonderry, considered to be the
OL,9,Flargest of its kind in Europe
OL,11,FIt is making its way through the city
OL,12,Fcentre and will be followed by a
OL,13,Fspectacular fireworks display on the
OL,14,Friverfront
OL,16,FPeople from all over the world are in
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland's second city for the
OL,18,Fconclusion of the four-day carnival,
OL,19,Fwhich is marking its 40th anniversary
